'''The 2026 Milan–San Remo''' was the 117th edition of the [[Milan–San Remo]] one-day race, held on 21 March 2026.

== Previous edition ==
The 2025 edition was won by [[Mathieu van der Poel]] ahead of [[Filippo Ganna]] and [[Tadej Pogačar]].
